- SNR-ENG-001: NUMISONA: track `data`: time follows field `day`, which has role x (RFC-0001 §5).
- SNR-ENG-002: NUMISONA: track `data`: the instrument is `mallet`, the harmonic mallet-like default (SDR-29).
